**DIRAC
.WAVE FUNCTION
.PROPERTIES
**MOLECULE
*BASIS
! Use the same basis for all atoms.
.DEFAULT
aug-cc-pVTZ
! The aug-cc-pVTZ basis is nonrelativistic and not suitable
! for heavy elements!
**HAMILTONIAN
! Use the exact two-component with atomic mean field spin-orbit
.X2C
! Use the B3LYP functional with default parameters
.DFT
 B3LYP
**INTEGRALS
*READIN
! A limitation in the AMFI code requires an uncontracted basis
.UNCONTRACT
**WAVE FUNCTION
.DHF
**PROPERTIES
! Run excitation energies
*EXCITATIONS
! Compute transition moments in the length gauge
.A OPERATOR
 XDIPLEN
.A OPERATOR
 YDIPLEN
.A OPERATOR
 ZDIPLEN
! Number of excitations in each boson irrep
.EXCITATIONS
 2 8
.EXCITATIONS
 5 8
! Analyze orbital contributions to each excitation
.ANALYZE
*END OF
